  "sourceTitle": "Maple Bacon Vinaigrette",
  "sourceText": "Maple Bacon Vinaigrette\nBy: Andie Mitchell\nPublished: Thursday, July 8, 2010 - 9:31am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 tablespoons extra-virgin olive oil\n1/4 cup apple cider vinegar\n2 tablespoons bacon drippings\n1 1/2 tablespoons maple syrup\n1 tablespoon spicy brown mustard\n1 teaspoon salt\n1 teaspoon freshly ground pepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Whisk all ingredients together in a small bowl until well combined.\n\nAbout\n\n\nA delicious blend of sweet maple syrup, smoky bacon, and spicy Dijon mustard. Perfect for a salad composed of crisp romaine lettuce, chopped tomatoes, crumbled blue cheese, and thinly slice red onion.",
  "parsedSource": {
